<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🇭🇰 香港生活數學</div>數學喺日常生活中無處不在！由茶餐廳計數到搭車時間，由買嘢找續到睇樓面積，全部都係數學。今日我哋就用香港人嘅生活場景嚟學數學，等你發現：原來數學咁有用、咁好玩！</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>快速心算：99 + 45 = ？（提示：99 = 100 - 1，所以 100+45-1=?）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>估算：198 + 203 大約係幾多？A. 300 B. 400 C. 500</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>快速心算：25 x 4 = ？（提示：25 = 100 ÷ 4）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>估算：47 x 3 大約係幾多？47 ≈ 50，50 x 3 = ?</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>小明說：「389 + 412 ≈ 800」。呢個估算合理嗎？點解？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘） ＋ 例題練習</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：數字組合心算術<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>湊十法：</strong>見到可以加埋=10嘅數字，先組合！<br>
   例：7+8+3+2 = (7+3)+(8+2) = 10+10 = <strong>20</strong><br>
② <strong>補數法：</strong>用最接近嘅整數，再加減返<br>
   例：99+56 = 100+56-1 = <strong>155</strong><br/>
③ <strong>拆數法：</strong>將數字拆開方便計算<br/>
   例：18x5 = (10+8)x5 = 50+40 = <strong>90</strong>
</br></br></br></div></div>
<div class="lf-why">
<div class="lf-why-title">WHY BOX：為甚麼有這麼多不同單位？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
mm→cm→m→km（相差10/100/1000倍）<br/>
<b>口訣：</b>大→小：乘；小→大：除<br/>
3.5km=3500m ✅（不是350m！）<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">km→m乘1000，kg→g乘1000，L→mL乘1000。</em>
</div>
</div>
<div class="strategy-card">
<div class="card">
<div class="strat-name">湊十法</div>
<div class="strat-ex">6+4+7+3+8+2<br/>=(6+4)+(7+3)+(8+2)<br/>=10+10+10=<strong>30</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="strat-name">補數法</div>
<div class="strat-ex">198+67<br/>=200+67-2<br/>=267-2=<strong>265</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="strat-name">拆數法</div>
<div class="strat-ex">16x3<br/>=(10+6)x3<br/>=30+18=<strong>48</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="strat-name">倍半法</div>
<div class="strat-ex">25x8<br/>=100÷4x8<br/>=100x2=<strong>200</strong></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：心算策略</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">用心算最快嘅方法計：199 + 298 + 397 = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><strong>補數法：</strong><br/>199 = 200-1<br/>298 = 300-2<br/>397 = 400-3<br/>加埋 = (200+300+400) - (1+2+3) = 900 - 6 = <strong>894</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>用湊十法：3+9+7+1 = (3+?)+(9+?) = ?</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>用補數法：299 + 85 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>用拆數法：23 x 4 = ？（拆成 20+3）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>99 + 99 + 99 = ？（用心算最快方法）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：估算的三大法則<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① <strong>法則一：四捨五入</strong>到最接近嘅整十/整百<br/>
   例：43 → 40（捨），47 → 50（入），152 → 150 或 200<br/>
② <strong>法則二：用簡單數字替代</strong><br/>
   例：398 x 3 ≈ 400 x 3 = <strong>1200</strong><br/>
③ <strong>法則三：估算結果要合理</strong>（唔可以同真實答案差太遠！）<br/>
   例：198+203 ≈ 200+200 = <strong>400</strong>（真實=401，好接近！）
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2：估算練習</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">估算：287 + 314 + 195 大約係幾多？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">287 ≈ <strong>300</strong>（四捨五入）<br/>314 ≈ <strong>300</strong>（四捨五入）<br/>195 ≈ <strong>200</strong>（四捨五入）<br/>估算：300+300+200 = <strong>800</strong><br/>真實答案：287+314+195 = <strong>796</strong> → 估算好接近！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 3：估算 ≠ 亂估</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">小明估算 47 x 9 = 47 x 10 = 470。呢個估算好唔好？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 估算關鍵：四捨五入後嘅數字要容易計！通常四捨五入到最接近嘅整十或整百！</div>
<div class="lf-tip">💡 估算三步：先四捨五入 → 用心算快計 → 檢查估算結果是否合理</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>估算：312 + 489 ≈ ＿＿ + ＿＿ = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>估算：68 x 7 ≈ 70 x 7 = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>以下邊個估算最合理？198+305 A.~400 B.~500 C.~600</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>估算：796 - 203 ≈ ＿＿ - ＿＿ = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：用心算驗證答案<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
① 做完題目 → <strong>立即用估算驗證</strong>答案是否合理<br/>
② 例：287 x 3 = 861 → 估算：300x3=900，861接近900，合理 ✓<br/>
③ 如果計到 561 或 1161 → 就知道一定出錯！<br/>
④ <strong>好習慣：</strong>每次做完計數，都要問自己：「呢個答案合理嗎？」
</div></div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🎯 陷阱Boss大決戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">呢一關有3條Boss級陷阱題！每條題有兩個陷阱疊加，要全部搵出嚟先算過關！全部過關獲得「陷阱大師」金章！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚔️ 挑戰Boss →</div></div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">睇住題目，3 秒內講出估算答案！<br/>例如：「48+51」→ 即答「約 100！」</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-notes lf-no-break"><div class="lf-notes-title">課堂筆記 / 草稿區</div><div class="lf-notes-lines"></div></div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
